New object type "Portal Implementations". Each Portal Implementation has a keyword and a name, both unique, plus a description and a type (@PHP@ or @Java@); creator, creation date, last editor and last edit date are recorded automatically. Portal Implementations are managed with the new REST resource @/portalimplementations@. Permissions work like those on ContentRepositories: on Portal Implementations as a whole (view, assign permissions, create) and on each one (view, assign permissions, edit, delete). On update, every group gets the same permissions on Portal Implementations that it has on ContentRepositories.
